Bundled audio
-------------

src/main/resources/com/vinnyvangogh/combatvitals/sounds/*.wav
  Soft chime, Music box and Retro blip are synthesised from sine and square
  waves by tools/sounds/generate_packs.py. No samples or third-party audio;
  they are this project's own work under its BSD 2-Clause licence.

src/main/resources/com/vinnyvangogh/combatvitals/voice/*.wav
  Rendered offline by tools/voice/generate_voice.py with:
  - Kokoro-82M, by hexgrad, Apache License 2.0
    https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
    The model card states the weights and voices are released under
    Apache 2.0, which permits redistribution, including commercial use.
    Voice "af_heart": a synthetic voice, not a recording or imitation of any
    real person.
  - kokoro-onnx, by thewh1teagle, MIT License
    https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx
  The words spoken are listed in voice/lines.tsv.

